{"id":"beaf37c29f1d1244","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-tree11-node-successor-cone.md","title":"ZFC Tree11 Node Successor Cone","display":"df-zfc-tree11-node-successor-cone — ZFC Tree11 Node Successor Cone","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-node-successor-cone","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-node-successor-cone"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-node-successor-cone — ZFC Tree11 Node Successor Cone","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-node-successor-cone"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-node-successor-cone</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-node-successor-cone — ZFC Tree11 Node Successor Cone"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3adf71d4c50f128\" href=\"?note=c3adf71d4c50f128\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node\">58-df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,T,t,R\\in V\">\\(C,T,t,R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9ConeAboveNode}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9ConeAboveNode}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c3adf71d4c50f128\" href=\"?note=c3adf71d4c50f128\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node\">58-df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11NodeSuccessorCone}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11NodeSuccessorCone}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}node\\text{-}successor\\text{-}cone} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11NodeSuccessorCone}_S(C,T,t)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR=\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in T^2:u\\subseteq v\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree9ConeAboveNode}_S(C,T,R,t)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}node\\text{-}successor\\text{-}cone} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11NodeSuccessorCone}_S(C,T,t)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR=\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in T^2:u\\subseteq v\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree9ConeAboveNode}_S(C,T,R,t)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the exact specialization of the upstream four-place cone predicate to the set relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in T^2:u\\subseteq v\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in T^2:u\\subseteq v\\}\\)</span>; it neither passes a proper-class relation as an argument nor treats the predicate as a set-valued operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node","status":"resolved","id":"c3adf71d4c50f128","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node","status":"resolved","id":"c3adf71d4c50f128","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree9ConeAboveNode}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[58-df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,T,t,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9ConeAboveNode}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11NodeSuccessorCone}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}node\\text{-}successor\\text{-}cone} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11NodeSuccessorCone}_S(C,T,t)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR=\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in T^2:u\\subseteq v\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree9ConeAboveNode}_S(C,T,R,t)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in T^2:u\\subseteq v\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1125,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3796","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-tree11-node-successor-cone.md|58-df-zfc-tree11-node-successor-cone]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","c3adf71d4c50f128"]}